==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|pulmonarius|pulmōnārius|of the lungs|lang=la}}, from {{term|pulmo|pulmō|lung|lang=la}} + {{term|-arius|-ārius|lang=la}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|pléu-mon-}}. Cognate with Greek {{term|πλεμόνι|lang=el}}, French {{term|poumon|lang=fr}}, Lithuanian {{term|plauciai|lang=lt}}, Polish {{term|płuco|lang=pl}} and Russian {{term|плавать||to swim|lang=ru}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Pertaining to, having, or affecting the [[lung]]s.

